    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000q76g](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000q76g) Magnitude 5.7 earthquake at 94.086 depth occurred on Apr 19 2025 32km S of Zebak. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 36.2444 longitude 71.2852. It impacted 60322 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
